喷绘的白色“H”，位于鹅卵石小道上，旁边是长椅和绿植。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A blue and white utility box with graffiti art resembling clouds and a white "H" spray-painted on the top half, situated on a cobblestone path beside a bench and greenery.

